(GPL-2.0-or-later; see LICENSE / NOTICE in this directory.)

Layout: FLAT -- all headers and sources in this one directory, so a single
include path (-Ivendor/weirdike) resolves every bare #include.

Contents = upstream include/ + src/core/ + src/esp/ + src/crypto/.

NOT vendored, on purpose:

  src/transport/udp_bsd.*   The daemon brings its own transport. udp_bsd owns
                            its socket and offers a blocking recv(); weirdiked
                            needs the opposite: it polls the sockets itself
                            together with the TUN fd and the control socket,
                            demultiplexes UDP-4500 with natt_classify() and
                            feeds only the IKE datagrams to
                            weirdike_input_datagram(). Its transport vtable
                            therefore has a send() and a recv() that always
                            reports "nothing" -- the same split the ESP32
                            integration uses.

  examples/, tests/         Host-only.

DO NOT edit these files in place. To update: re-copy from upstream and bump the
SHA above.
